        "text": "The deploy-uni-hook skill was silently failing on shared runners because foundryup's unauthenticated GitHub API call hit per-IP rate limits, and the failure was swallowed by >/dev/null 2>&1 || true. Replaced with SHA-pinned foundry-rs/foundry-toolchain action (token-authed, cached). Ports a proven fix from the canon repo.",
